  Source URL: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Connum/hanzivg/master/hanzi/<hex>.svg
              (falling back to .../master/kanji/<hex>.svg)
  Bundled file: assets/data/hsk1_hanzivg.json

HanziVG states its own licence in its README:

  "HanziVG is licenced under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
   Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0)."

HanziVG is itself "heavily based on KanjiVG" (https://kanjivg.tagaini.net/), and
its README records that it also reuses "the great work by Francois Mizessyn at
AnimHanzi", who created all HSK1-3 characters. The fetch script falls back to
HanziVG's bundled `kanji/` copies of KanjiVG files for characters HanziVG does
not yet cover; those rows are marked `"source": "kanjivg"` in the JSON.


